# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Sama Sama - samasamaguides.com  |  Netlify redirect table
#
# The 28 PDF guides link ONLY to samasamaguides.com/g/<city>.
# Those links are printed into sold PDFs and can never be changed,
# so this file is where the real destination lives. Change a line
# here, redeploy, and every guide ever sold points somewhere new.
#
# Rules are matched TOP TO BOTTOM. The /* catch-all MUST stay last.
# 302 = temporary. Never use 301 here - browsers cache 301s
# forever and you lose the ability to re-point.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

